WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:03.800
Begin in your travel album.

00:04.000 --> 00:07.800
Explore twelve cities along one route.

00:08.000 --> 00:12.300
Choose your next flight from Departures.

00:12.500 --> 00:15.300
Read the clues around the 5 × 5 grid.

00:15.400 --> 00:18.800
A 5 fills the whole row.

00:19.000 --> 00:23.900
Follow the column clues.

00:24.000 --> 00:30.300
A completed puzzle becomes a photo.

00:30.400 --> 00:35.000
Keep the view in your album.
